  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> form an equilateral triangle with origin. Then, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are vertices of equilateral triangles</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>squaring both sides</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
